  - exact bootq_1RB1LD_0LC0RB_1LD0LD_1LA0RB.
  - intros p _. apply lap_1RB1LD_0LC0RB_1LD0LD_1LA0RB.
  - intros t Ht p _. apply fire_1RB1LD_0LC0RB_1LD0LD_1LA0RB. exact Ht.
  - exact wit_1RB1LD_0LC0RB_1LD0LD_1LA0RB.
  - vm_cast_no_check (eq_refl true).
Qed.

